# Story: a writer docks a browser and notes on either side of the Desktop,
# adds mail under the browser, focuses on the browser, then comes back.
# Reference: T01 T02 T03 T30 T32 T34. Window ids start at 101.
open Safari
open Notes
open Mail
dock 101 left
expect ok
expect docked 101
dock 102 right
expect left-of 101 102
expect count docked 2
dock 103 beside 101 bottom
expect above 101 103
expect camera root
zoom 101
expect fills 101
expect hidden 102
expect hidden 103
expect camera 101
back
expect visible 102
expect visible 103
expect camera root
out
expect fail
